007700
007800 COPY MSTORERM   IN COPYLIB.
007900 COPY MREQ       IN COPYLIB.
008000 COPY DREQD      IN COPYLIB.
008100 COPY DREQITM    IN COPYLIB.
008200 COPY DREQDESC   IN COPYLIB.
008300 COPY DPOITEM    IN COPYLIB.
008400 COPY DPORECD    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DINVRCD    IN COPYLIB.
